      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_115734fw31",
          "type": "heading",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "text": "Client love",
            "level": "h2",
            "size": "auto",
            "eyebrow": "Kind words"
          },
          "variant": "plain"
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_2hs20qw5wc",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "blockquote",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“A friend of mine described Courtney as an earth angel, and after doing an immersion with her, I feel this is so TRUE. She is a soul steward, a priestess sister, and a divine mirror to reflect your light back to you and offer the practical tools for diving in deeper and shining even brighter. If you are looking to up-level your business, spiritual practice, sensuality, your at-homeness in your body, or feel more empowered on the next steps of your path, Courtneys is your girl.”"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Dani Frederick",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " · "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Songstress, Divine Feminine Mystic",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_69m14j32vz",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "blockquote",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“I had a week-long immersion with Courtney and experienced one of the most beautiful weeks of my life. The flow, grace, power, magic, and healing was beyond any expectation. It was pure spirit working through. The way Courtney weaves her intuition with inner child healing, movement, song, ceremony, trauma healing, adventure, and play is mind-blowing. I feel the integration and return of lost pieces of my soul. There was so much clearing of past guilt, shame, and patterns of shutting down. This was the safest container to open, surrender, trust, and unravel. I feel whole, like I've stepped into a new self.”"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Mariana Grace",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " · "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Hypnotherapist, Ceremonial Guide",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_07vyx5wsg7",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "blockquote",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“This Retreat felt like a true initiation into living in my highest devotion to self and my purpose. There were many moments when I could feel myself pressing up against my comfort zone, but I never felt an “I can’t do this” sensation in my body. I know it was because Courtney and all the women created such a safe space for us all to be messy, imperfect, and beautiful.”"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Ava Johanna",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " · "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Bloom Retreat, Kauai",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_vh8xag5x4t",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "blockquote",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“My soul needed this. I felt enveloped with a deep sense of joy and belonging that I have never experienced so strongly before. I knew this experience was a gift from Spirit. I really loved the incredible energy of nature surrounding this beautiful home and is all over this sacred island. The love shared by Courtney was an inspiring gift from the first moment of connection.”"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Rebecca Lash",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " · "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Bloom Retreat, Kauai",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_gf7swaww2y",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_7hs7mw22wg",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "blockquote",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“I want to shout from the rooftops about Courtney and what a great facilitator she is. I dare say she is the best facilitator I have ever experienced. I was able to connect with her deeper than anyone else. She took me deep into myself and led me to connecting with my higher self and deepening my confidence in my power and voice. Courtney holds a very kind and loving space. My heart is full. Thank you Courtney for being a divine vessel for assisting me and letting myself be all that I can be.”"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Barbara",
                      "marks": [
